        "title": "Olivia Rodrigo Essentials",
        "numberOfTracks": 20,
        "numberOfVideos": 0,
        "creator": {},
        "description": "In 2021, \u201cDriver\u2019s License\u201d catapulted Olivia Rodrigo to the top of the Billboard Hot 100 and her subsequent debut album, SOUR, established Olivia as a bonafide pop star of the new generation. \n\nTaking vocal lessons and learning piano at a young age, Olivia would go on to pick up the guitar around age 12 and start honing her songwriting abilities, which are now known for her raw and honest lyrics. Her punk pop sensibilities are tempered with throwback 90\u2019s vibes and emotional ballads. Get to know Olivia's Essentials on TIDAL.\n\n(Photo: Geffen Records)",
